                                "sense_id": "d62125e0-d9b2-35b1-b235-c9b712c38604",
                                "text": "Running up through the crowds she looked at her watch and found she had still a half-hour to spare, saw her face as she whipped into Woolies[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b491056f-e775-46ae-aa73-43a4c2026e99",
                                "sense_id": "d62125e0-d9b2-35b1-b235-c9b712c38604",
                                "text": "It's also possible to pop into Woolies and buy a pre-paid mobile phone for as little as $99 including a rechargeable SIM card[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5f3b608-9e8d-4caf-a283-aa90cf761f3a",
                                "sense_id": "d62125e0-d9b2-35b1-b235-c9b712c38604",
                                "text": "Of course, the kids loved it, even toddlers were heard to garble \"I'm a twisted firestarter\" while dragging their hapless mums into Woolies to bag a copy."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
